# Conforming fixture: a word form naming exactly one sign system (lang:FormSituatedShape).

@prefix lang: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/lang/> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/lang/> .

ex:english a lang:SignSystem .
ex:lexeme a lang:Lexeme ; lang:inSignSystem ex:english .
ex:w a lang:WordForm ;
    lang:inSignSystem ex:english ;
    lang:lexemeOf ex:lexeme .
